 r←Test_TableEdit_002(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Test "Create" with basic parms.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton')(1 0 1)
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←150 1000
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Democrat'
 parms.dataTypes←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.TableDataTypes.(Character Numeric)
 parms.addToCaption←'Testing Table.Run'
 parms.rowTitles←rowTitles←'First' 'Second' 'Third'
 parms.confirmQuit←0

 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.Create table #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress¨'Obhama'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress⊂'HT'
 0.1 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 table[0;0]←⊂'Obhama'
 →GoToTidyUp n.∆result≢table
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
